{"unit_id":"chenkui-luo__dsh-plugin-restart#card-zh","repo":"chenkui-luo/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"b307fb0bcf34b9b52841de95539c1d3d420c6109","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-restart 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的重启插件，在设置页加入重启面板。用户点击后，它启动辅助进程并委托本机启动器重启 dsh web；页面轮询服务状态，发现新实例后自动刷新重连。面板还显示当前实例、端口、工作目录和启动器状态，并提供日志查看接口。适合修改插件或配置后需要重新加载服务的场景；需要可用的 DeepSeek Harness 启动器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:378-429","lib/index.js:384-426","lib/index.js:483-503"]}
{"unit_id":"chenkui-luo__dsh-plugin-restart#card-en","repo":"chenkui-luo/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"b307fb0bcf34b9b52841de95539c1d3d420c6109","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-restart adds a restart panel to DSH web Settings. It delegates restart to the local launcher, polls for the new instance, and reloads the page to reconnect. The panel shows instance details and launcher status; a host route returns recent logs. A Harness launcher is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:378-429","lib/index.js:384-426","lib/index.js:483-503"]}
